From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 17:03:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 49/69] arm64: dts: qcom: pm7250b: Add the QGauge fuel gauge

Describe the QG block and the SDAM it keeps its state in, both from the
downstream device tree. Disabled by default.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm7250b.dtsi | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm7250b.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm7250b.dtsi
index 31d544c7d..ca4cb4afe 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm7250b.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm7250b.dtsi
@@ -65,6 +65,12 @@ pm7250b_charger: charger@1000 {
 			status = "disabled";
 		};
 
+		pm7250b_qg: fuel-gauge@4800 {
+			compatible = "qcom,pm7250b-qg";
+			reg = <0x4800>, <0xb100>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 		pm7250b_vbus: usb-vbus-regulator@1100 {
 			compatible = "qcom,pm7250b-vbus-reg", "qcom,pm8150b-vbus-reg";
 			reg = <0x1100>;
-- 
